  {
   "key": "krea_edit",
   "label": "✨ Krea2 Edit",
   "headline": "Tell it what to change. It changes only that.",
   "body": [
    "Drop in a photograph and type “make it snow”, or “give her a leather jacket”, or “take the car out of the driveway”. You get the same picture back with that one thing different — same face, same pose, same light, same everything you didn't mention.",
    "No masks, no layers, nothing to select. And because the person stays the person, you can keep going: the jacket, then the weather, then the time of day, one instruction at a time. Five edits later it's still the same shot, not a distant cousin of it."
   ],
   "highlights": [
    "Say it in a sentence",
    "Faces stay the same face",
    "Stack edit after edit",
    "Nothing to mask or select",
    "Send straight to another tab"
   ],
