   "label": "🎬 Wan Video",
   "headline": "Give a still picture a few seconds of life.",
   "body": [
    "Hand it any image — one you made here or one from your camera roll — describe the movement, and get a short clip back. Steam rising, hair moving, a slow push toward the subject, water doing what water does. The person in the picture stays the person in the picture.",
    "This is the one that usually costs by the second everywhere else. Here it doesn't cost anything at all, and that changes how you use it: make five versions, keep the one that moves right, throw the other four away without a thought."
